bbadiso bad_iso 0 V = (v(bad_sel_in_n)-v(bad_samp_tp_n))/vdd_val
* bad: input ramps one LSB per conversion THROUGH mid-scale
* (codes 507..515), so the run crosses the major carry where every
* bit changes at once -- the worst case for a late decision -- and
* exercises both branches of the free-MSB trial.
vbadin bad_vinp 0 pwl(0 {vcm-4.75*lsbse} 8u {vcm+3.25*lsbse})
vbadcm bad_vinn 0 dc {vcm}
bbadexp bad_exp 0 V = min(max(floor(v(bad_shxp)/lsbse),0),1023)
bbaderr bad_err 0 V = min(v(bad_drdy),v(bad_drdyg))>vth ? v(bad_code)-v(bad_exp) : 0
bbadaerr bad_aerr 0 V = abs(v(bad_err))

* ---- loop tie ----
vtiestart tie_start 0 pwl(0 {vdd_val} 125n {vdd_val} 125.1n 0)
vtiemode tie_mode 0 dc 0
xtie clk tie_start tie_mode tie_cmpo tie_samp_tp_n tie_sel_in_n tie_drdy
+ tie_c9 tie_c8 tie_c7 tie_c6 tie_c5 tie_c4 tie_c3 tie_c2 tie_c1 tie_c0
